<title>USA: Wall Street stocks higher at start.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks higher at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks moved higher in early trading, and the Dow was expected to move higher still after IBM opens.</p>
<p>The stock was up in preopen trading after reporting first quarter earnings.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrial index was up 36 at 6848.</p>
</text>
